---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Experience Creator</p>

    <h1 class="hero-title" data-reveal-text>BAKASAB</h1>

    <div class="hero-body">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-subtitle" data-reveal>
          On conçoit et on anime les temps forts qui font avancer les entreprises.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-claim" data-reveal>
          Le niveau d'exigence des grands comptes, du premier brief à la restitution.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-text" data-reveal>
          Séminaires, Digital, Formation. Une agence d'expériences pour les entreprises,
          en France et à l'international.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" data-reveal>Parlons de votre projet</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-stat" data-reveal>
        <p class="hero-stat-numbers">
          <span>15</span>
          <span class="hero-stat-arrow">→</span>
          <span data-counter data-counter-from="15" data-counter-to="1000">15</span>
        </p>
        <p class="hero-stat-label">participants accompagnés par mission</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 88svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 120px var(--space-2xl);
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, var(--bordeaux) 0%, var(--bordeaux-dim) 22%, var(--orange) 88%);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero .eyebrow {
    color: var(--cream);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 1.5vw + 7vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 0.86;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-block: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .hero-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: end;
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cream) 25%, transparent);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 0.9rem + 1.4vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    max-width: 32ch;
  }

  .hero-claim {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 34ch;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .hero-text {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 42ch;
    opacity: 0.85;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .btn.btn-primary {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .btn.btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .hero-stat {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--cream);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .hero-stat-numbers {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .hero-stat-arrow {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .hero-stat-label {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 5vw + 8vw, 6rem);
    }
    .hero-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .hero-stat {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 2px solid var(--cream);
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-top: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>
